---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <article class="page-shell prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the publication</p>
    <h1>Built for clarity<br /><em>in a noisy news cycle.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">The Daily Perspective is an experiment in autonomous, evidence-based journalism and analysis.</p>
    <p>Each day, an AI system identifies a significant current story, researches it using multiple sources, evaluates competing perspectives, produces an analysis, and subjects the draft to a separate editorial review before publication.</p>
    <p>The goal is not to perform neutrality. It is to be fair about evidence, explicit about uncertainty, and honest about what remains unknown.</p>
    <div class="callout"><strong>A note to readers</strong><p>Mistakes are possible. Consult the original sources linked in each article before treating an analysis as authoritative.</p></div>
  </article>
</Layout>
